WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.737
This query classifies product prices.

00:00:02.737 --> 00:00:05.342
Missing values are labeled missing.

00:00:05.342 --> 00:00:10.047
Zero or negative prices are flagged invalid and require review.

00:00:10.047 --> 00:00:13.237
Positive prices are valid candidates.

00:00:13.237 --> 00:00:16.677
Notice that the query does not change the values.

00:00:16.677 --> 00:00:22.347
Validation should often begin by identifying problems, not by overwriting them.

00:00:22.347 --> 00:00:27.127
Validation is rule-based detection, not automatic correction.

00:00:27.127 --> 00:00:31.302
A failed email-shape check tells you that a record deserves attention;

00:00:31.302 --> 00:00:33.827
it does not tell you the correct email.

00:00:33.827 --> 00:00:40.960
Treat quality flags as evidence that can drive quarantine, review, or a documented repair process.
